{"id":"ccbc11:problem:6","answer":"BUDGED","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"关于魔方的复原","html":"<p>剧情中的英文首字母提示了复原的方法</p>","text":"剧情中的英文首字母提示了复原的方法","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"关于答案的字母顺序","html":"<p>剧情中的英文首字母提示了提取字母的顺序</p>","text":"剧情中的英文首字母提示了提取字母的顺序","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>根据题设提示提取首字母<code>FLDUBR</code>，这是魔方的旋转公式，如图所示进行还原，再按照首字母对应的面提取字母即得答案：<strong>BUDGED</strong>。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"结果图示\" data-asset-id=\"asset-80794d5ba2a4b593d9302208\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc11/images/answer/answer6.gif\"/></p>","text":"根据题设提示提取首字母\nFLDUBR\n，这是魔方的旋转公式，如图所示进行还原，再按照首字母对应的面提取字母即得答案：\nBUDGED\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-80794d5ba2a4b593d9302208"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-80794d5ba2a4b593d9302208","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc11/images/answer/answer6.gif","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc11/images/answer/answer6.gif","mime":"image/gif","size":4843570,"sha256":"991d490b9dc0c1408aa8ebd022dff8bacc433656799979ed62727530a6c6c5df","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
